{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんばんは！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日の東京個別握手会\n先程無事に終わりましたー！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本日 21歳 最後の日"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日もあと残り数時間。。。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"取り急ぎ...\n今日は生誕祭を開いて頂きました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/reika.sakurai/img/blog/reika.sakurai/img/2016/05/15/1839768/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"じゃーーん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/reika.sakurai/img/blog/reika.sakurai/img/2016/05/15/1839768/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ダーーン"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/reika.sakurai/img/blog/reika.sakurai/img/2016/05/15/1839768/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"正直、こんなに沢山のファンの皆さんとメンバーに集まってもらえるなんて思っていなくて..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"貴重な時間を私にくれた今日1日、\n胸が苦しくなるくらい 幸せで溢れていました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近の自分を振り返ると、\n色んなコトを考える時間が多くなっていたからか、こんなに幸せを感じる瞬間は本当久々で..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"周りの人の優しさが胸にどんどん沁みて\n忘れかけていたモノを少し取り戻す様な\nそんな感覚がありました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"実は抱負とか全然考えてなくて、\n今の頭の中はじょしらく 一色でして...笑笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも、簡単に聞こえるかもしれないけれど\nやっぱり強く思うことは、\n『出来るだけ多くの時間を楽しく過ごしたい』"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"多分、自分の中での一生のテーマだと思います"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今の私は意識しないと難しいテーマだけど\nいつか無意識でも楽しい瞬間が増える様になりたい！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そのためにも、成長していかなきゃ！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"？？？？？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/reika.sakurai/img/blog/reika.sakurai/img/2016/05/15/1839768/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"何か頭働かない...笑\n私、何書きたいんだっけ？？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とにかく！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんな！今日は最高の1日をありがとーー！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/reika.sakurai/img/blog/reika.sakurai/img/2016/05/15/1839768/0004.jpeg","alt":""}],"source":"archive"}